# Line endings, and nothing else.
#
# NO export-ignore, deliberately. Two things depend on the full tree reaching a
# tagged release:
#
#   docs/   the documentation site builds from tags. Export-ignoring it makes a
#           documented package look undocumented, which is how this file was
#           wrong before: `/docs export-ignore` shipped v0.1.0 and v0.2.0 with
#           no documentation in the archive at all.
#
#   tests/  the security documentation points at specific tests as its evidence
#           — CredentialBoundaryTest for "a Secret is the only kind that can
#           carry a credential", ArchitectureTest for the purity rules. A claim
#           whose proof is not in the package is a claim you have to take on
#           trust.
#
# The sibling cboxdk packages ship their full tree for the same reasons. A few
# kilobytes is not a cost worth making either of those untrue.
* text=auto eol=lf
